-# The three art states of a rank in one place, so no screen has to re-derive
-# them: an uploaded image, one of the preset glyphs, or neither.
-#
-# Mirrors badges/_art and items/_art. Ranks were the last entity whose branch
-# lived only inside a wrapper — ranks/_rank_thumb, which bakes it into the mini
-# card. A screen that wants the bare art (the group overview's rank card) had
-# nothing to call and ended up nesting a 52px mini card inside a 200px art well.
-#
-# The fallback is the ranking-star the mini card has always shown for a rank
-# with no artwork — one default across the app, not one per screen.
- if rank.upload?
  = image_tag rank.icon, alt: ''
- elsif (glyph = gh_glyph(rank.icon_glyph))
  = glyph
- else
  %i.fa-solid.fa-ranking-star{ 'aria-hidden': 'true' }
